# Build context hygiene. Everything here is either regenerated inside the
# image, irrelevant to it, or must never enter it.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.nx
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.media-store
# Secrets. `.env` is gitignored, so it is not in the repository -- but it IS on
# a developer's disk, and `docker build .` from there would copy it into a
# layer. A secret baked into an image layer survives every later deletion.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/backups
**/*.dump
